  "summary": "Runtime dependency resolved from an unpinned GitHub repository",
  "details": "package.json declares the runtime dependency \"libsignal\" as \"github:tenka-san/libsignal-node\" with no commit SHA, tag, or integrity check. On npm install this resolves to whatever HEAD of that repository is at install time, and any lifecycle scripts inside that repository execute during installation. Whoever controls the tenka-san/libsignal-node GitHub repository controls code that is installed into the installer's node_modules whenever noverojava is installed.",
